                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Access to housing isn't a partisan issue;\u00a0it affects every American. As the vice-chair of the Housing and Insurance Subcommittee, I'm expanding access to housing and reducing production costs through my bipartisan HUD-USDA-VA Interagency Coordination Act. We're ensuring collaboration among all three agencies to tackle the rising costs and limited availability of housing in our communities!",
